flowchart TD
    subgraph HOST["Host Subsystem (CPU / Python 3.11)"]
        IC["Initial Conditions Generator<br>• 1 Heavy Center (M = 1.2)<br>• 149 Orbiters (m = 10⁻⁵)<br>• Inclined Keplerian Disk (i ∈ ±0.05 rad)<br>• COM Momentum Balance (||P|| < 10⁻¹⁴)"]
        CFG["Simulation Constants<br>• G = 1.0, Plummer ε = 0.02<br>• Adaptive η = 0.05, Δt_fixed = 0.005"]
